      "widgets_values": [
        "## EcoHash text to video\n\nSelect a connection and an available text-to-video model, then enter your prompt, duration and size. Model capabilities come from the service; common size presets do not guarantee support. VIDEO → Save Video preserves any returned MP4 audio.\n\nNo protocol configuration is needed. Native deployment adaptation belongs to the service. Models requiring reference media need a workflow supporting those inputs.\n\nAdvanced settings: leave job_id blank for a new generation, or enter an existing ID to resume without another submission. Keep the same connection. Interrupting ComfyUI stops local waiting, not the remote job."
